# 📊 Staff Management System API

## Base URL
```
http://localhost:8000/api
```

## Authentication
Include Bearer token in headers:
```
Authorization: Bearer {token}
```

---

## 👥 User Management

### Get All Users
**GET** `/api/users`
- Query: `?user_type=staff&search=john&page=1`

### Create User
**POST** `/api/users`
```json
{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john@example.com", 
  "password": "password123",
  "password_confirmation": "password123",
  "user_type": "staff"
}
```

### Get User
**GET** `/api/users/{id}`

### Update User
**PUT** `/api/users/{id}`
```json
{
  "name": "John Smith",
  "email": "johnsmith@example.com"
}
```

### Delete User
**DELETE** `/api/users/{id}`

### Get Staff Only
**GET** `/api/staff`

### Get User Stats
**GET** `/api/user-stats`

